* Two parallel 5 cm wires, 2 mm apart — a two-port to show mutual inductance.
.units m
N1 x=0    y=0     z=0
N2 x=0.05 y=0     z=0
N3 x=0    y=0.002 z=0
N4 x=0.05 y=0.002 z=0
E1 N1 N2 w=0.0002 h=0.0002 sigma=5.8e7
E2 N3 N4 w=0.0002 h=0.0002 sigma=5.8e7
.external N1 N2 porta
.external N3 N4 portb
.freq fmin=1e8 fmax=1e8 ndec=1
.end
